In Manilla, the Philippine capital, a former policeman from the Philippines has taken tourists from Hong Kong hostage by hijacking their bus.
With his M16 rifle Rolando Mendoza shot at the tourists.
Several hostages have been brought to safety and, for the time being, at least six fatalities have been confirmed.
