Maybe after the movie National Treasure you think there's a treasure map behind the Declaration of Independence.
However, that is based on a misconception. There is something written on the back, but it is not a treasure map.
On the back of the U.S. Declaration of Independence are the words 'Original U.S. Declaration of Independence, dd. 4 July 1776'. The text is at the bottom of the document.
