Winter sports where you descend, such as skiing and snowboarding, are very popular. You glide down on a snow-covered descent with skis or a snowboard at your feet.
Skiing is a popular travel activity with many enthusiasts, who are also occasionally called 'ski bums', who plan entire holidays around skiing in a certain location.
Skiing has been around for a very long time: there are cave paintings of skiers dating back to 5000 BC!
The beginning of the ski sport dates at least from the 17th century and in 1861 the first recreational ski resort in Australia was opened by Norwegians.
